  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Civil Society for Climate Justice and Environment Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;overall objective&lt;/strong&gt; of the project is to enhance the contribution of Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) and Environmental Human Rights Defenders (EHRDs) to a healthy, clean, safe environment and a low-carbon and climate-resilient economy and society. The &lt;strong&gt;specific objective&lt;/strong&gt; of the project is to contribute to achieving the following priorities: strengthening CSOs to advocate for land rights, solutions to water-logging and deforestation, and the promotion of clean energy; to engage in research, collaboration, and advocacy for inclusive climate decision-making processes and access to climate information; and to use a rights-based approach to address harms caused by climate change and environmental degradation and their interface with economic development.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
